msgid "Remove File from List"
msgstr "Rimuovi File dalla Lista"

#. translators: headerbar main menu item
msgid "_New Window"
msgstr "_Nuova finestra"

#. translators: headerbar main menu item. This one clears the file list, it will remove all files from the list. Please make sure it's clear that this will NOT delete the files on disk, it will only remove them from the list.
msgid "_Remove All Files"
msgstr "_Rimuovi Tutti i File"

#. translators: headerbar main menu item
msgid "_Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "_Scorciatoie da tastiera"

#. translators: headerbar main menu item. Metadata Cleaner is the app name.
msgid "_About Metadata Cleaner"
msgstr "_Informazioni su Pulitore di Metadati"

#. translators: tooltip text for the headerbar menu button
msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "Opzioni"

#. translators: tooltip text for a button next to the "clean" button. It opens a settings dialog for cleaning-process related settings.
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni"

#. translators: cleaning option row title
msgid "Lightweight Cleaning"
msgstr "Pulizia leggera"

#. translators: cleaning option row subtitle. This describes what "Lightweight cleaning" is. Please be as clear as possible and don't assume the user knows what everything is
msgid ""
"By default, the removal process might alter a bit the data of your files, in "
"order to remove as much metadata as possible. For example, texts in PDF "
"might not be selectable anymore, compressed images might get compressed "
"again… The lightweight mode, while not as thorough, will not make "
"destructive changes to your files."
msgstr ""
"Da default, per rimuovere più metadati possibili, il processo potrebbe "
"alterare parte dei dati dei vostri file. Per esempio, campi di testo in file "
"PDF potrebbero non essere più selezionabili, immagini compresse potrebbero "
"subire ulteriore compressione ecc. La modalità Leggera, seppur non "
"approfondita come il processo di default, non causerà cambiamenti "
"distruttivi ai vostri file."

#. translators: button that cancels the cleaning process
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancella"

#. translators: headerbar button menu item that opens the file picker
msgid "Add Files…"
msgstr "Aggiungi Files…"

#. translators: headerbar button menu item that opens the folder picker
msgid "Add Folders…"
msgstr "Aggiungi Cartelle…"

#. translators: overlay shown when dragging files above the app
msgid "Drop files or folders to clean them"
msgstr "Lascia file o cartelle qui per pulirle"

#. translators: headerbar button that opens a menu to pick files or folders and add them to the list aka "Add Files/Folders"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Aggiungi"

#. translators: tooltip text on a headerbar button that toggles the side panel for metadata viewing
msgid "Toggle Metadata"
msgstr "Mostra/Nascondi Metadati"

#. translators: subtitle in the empty view, drop as in drag-n-drop
msgid "Drop files here to clean them"
msgstr "Lascia i file qui per pulirli"

