#. translators: tooltip text on the badge that shows an
#. icon representing the state of the file
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Errore"

#. translators: tooltip text on the badge that shows an
#. icon representing the state of the file
msgid "Cleaned"
msgstr "Pulito"

#. translators: side panel message when selecting a file that
